  "_stdlib": "The enumerated roster (LLP 1004 D2/D4): every callable an expression may name, with its parameter types and return type (`any` = one of number, string, bool, list). The compiler checks calls against this table; the runner's VM implements each entry once; entries are added by fixture, never by speculation.",
  "stdlib": [
